   "content": "<p>NEAR network moves to cut annual token issuance from 2.5% to 1.6%</p><p>NEAR governance approved a plan to lower its maximum annual token issuance rate to 1.6%, ending a period of high growth in supply.</p><p><a href=\"https://newisty.com/blog/near-network-moves-to-cut-annual-token-issuance-from-25-to-16?utm_source=social&amp;utm_campaign=crypto_news\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" translate=\"no\"><span class=\"invisible\">https://</span><span class=\"ellipsis\">newisty.com/blog/near-network-</span><span class=\"invisible\">moves-to-cut-annual-token-issuance-from-25-to-16?utm_source=social&amp;utm_campaign=crypto_news</span></a></p><p><a href=\"https://mastodon.social/tags/near\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>near</span></a> <a href=\"https://mastodon.social/tags/tokenomics\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>tokenomics</span></a> <a href=\"https://mastodon.social/tags/governance\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>governance</span></a></p>",
