   "content": "<p>NEAR governance proposes 36% reduction in token issuance, dividing validators</p><p>NEAR&#39;s House of Stake proposal HSP-029 would lower the annual token issuance cap from 2.5% to 1.6%, reducing staking rewards and requiring validator upgrades.</p><p><a href=\"https://newisty.com/blog/near-governance-proposes-36-reduction-in-token-issuance-dividing-validators?utm_source=social&amp;utm_campaign=crypto_news\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" translate=\"no\"><span class=\"invisible\">https://</span><span class=\"ellipsis\">newisty.com/blog/near-governan</span><span class=\"invisible\">ce-proposes-36-reduction-in-token-issuance-dividing-validators?utm_source=social&amp;utm_campaign=crypto_news</span></a></p><p><a href=\"https://mastodon.social/tags/near\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>near</span></a> <a href=\"https://mastodon.social/tags/staking\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>staking</span></a> <a href=\"https://mastodon.social/tags/governance\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>governance</span></a></p>",
